{"3150750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wilds - Night Zookeeper", "steam_appid": 3150750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world shaped by your imagination</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Wilds - Night Zookeeper, a multiplayer adventure where the creatures, stories, and chaos are created by you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create completely original creatures using unique drawing and creation systems, then watch them become living, playable companions in a world of fast-paced multiplayer games, strange discoveries, and fantastic stories where anything can happen. From banana-farting monkeys to turtle-cars with laser eyes, if you can imagine it, you can create it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way you design, customise, and develop them shapes how you play, compete, and interact with the world around you. Every player helps build an ever-expanding universe of unique characters, powers, items, and ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/extras/9abfc6e42d1d8c23193a6e61c28f3f94.poster.avif?t=1783516200\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/extras/9abfc6e42d1d8c23193a6e61c28f3f94.webm?t=1783516200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/extras/9abfc6e42d1d8c23193a6e61c28f3f94.mp4?t=1783516200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chaotic multiplayer where anything can happen</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete across a huge range of fast, unpredictable multiplayer games where strategy, teamwork, creativity, and pure chaos collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment you’re battling for victory in a frantic Light Ball match, the next you’re being chased through the woods by Stifle the Gorilla while the Chaos Dice unleashes complete madness into the game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/extras/e7670c54b16b70a91fd530308db80ee3.poster.avif?t=1783516200\" aria-label=\"Chaotic multiplayer where anything can happen \" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/extras/e7670c54b16b70a91fd530308db80ee3.webm?t=1783516200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/extras/e7670c54b16b70a91fd530308db80ee3.mp4?t=1783516200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your unique collection of Creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and collect Wilds; unique creatures created by players from around the world! Build a growing collection of bizarre, funny, powerful, and completely unique creatures authored by the community itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new favourites in the Pond of Possibilities, trade discoveries with friends, and build a collection unlike anyone else’s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/extras/d321991e234ee8d8f2db65cec6617e2a.poster.avif?t=1783516200\" aria-label=\"Build your unique collection of Wilds\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/extras/d321991e234ee8d8f2db65cec6617e2a.webm?t=1783516200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/extras/d321991e234ee8d8f2db65cec6617e2a.mp4?t=1783516200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No two adventures are ever the same</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wilds - Night Zookeeper is a living world built by you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your creations will become collectable characters, unlockable items, new attacks, world objects, or even future game modes used by other players across the game. Early players aren’t just joining a game, they’re helping shape a creative universe that will continue to grow and evolve over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/extras/564b4b26ff7efd59268b254de5074da1.poster.avif?t=1783516200\" aria-label=\"No two adventures are ever the same\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/extras/564b4b26ff7efd59268b254de5074da1.webm?t=1783516200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/extras/564b4b26ff7efd59268b254de5074da1.mp4?t=1783516200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built by Night Zookeeper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by the BAFTA nominated team at Night Zookeeper, Wilds builds on 15 years of helping millions of children explore creativity, storytelling, drawing, and imagination through games, books, and interactive worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Draw and bring to life your own completely original Wilds creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Your creations become living, playable companions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast-paced multiplayer party games full of chaos and strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Endless combinations of player-created characters, powers, and loadouts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A living world shaped by community creativity and co-creation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explore strange locations, bizarre events, and unpredictable gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Collect, customise, and develop your Wilds over time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Built around creativity, imagination, and expressive play</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world shaped by your imagination</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Wilds - Night Zookeeper, a multiplayer adventure where the creatures, stories, and chaos are created by you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create completely original creatures using unique drawing and creation systems, then watch them become living, playable companions in a world of fast-paced multiplayer games, strange discoveries, and fantastic stories where anything can happen. From banana-farting monkeys to turtle-cars with laser eyes, if you can imagine it, you can create it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way you design, customise, and develop them shapes how you play, compete, and interact with the world around you. Every player helps build an ever-expanding universe of unique characters, powers, items, and ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/extras/9abfc6e42d1d8c23193a6e61c28f3f94.poster.avif?t=1783516200\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/extras/9abfc6e42d1d8c23193a6e61c28f3f94.webm?t=1783516200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/extras/9abfc6e42d1d8c23193a6e61c28f3f94.mp4?t=1783516200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chaotic multiplayer where anything can happen</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete across a huge range of fast, unpredictable multiplayer games where strategy, teamwork, creativity, and pure chaos collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment you’re battling for victory in a frantic Light Ball match, the next you’re being chased through the woods by Stifle the Gorilla while the Chaos Dice unleashes complete madness into the game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/extras/e7670c54b16b70a91fd530308db80ee3.poster.avif?t=1783516200\" aria-label=\"Chaotic multiplayer where anything can happen \" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/extras/e7670c54b16b70a91fd530308db80ee3.webm?t=1783516200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/extras/e7670c54b16b70a91fd530308db80ee3.mp4?t=1783516200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your unique collection of Creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and collect Wilds; unique creatures created by players from around the world! Build a growing collection of bizarre, funny, powerful, and completely unique creatures authored by the community itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new favourites in the Pond of Possibilities, trade discoveries with friends, and build a collection unlike anyone else’s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poste