illions of children explore creativity, storytelling, drawing, and imagination through games, books, and interactive worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Draw and bring to life your own completely original Wilds creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Your creations become living, playable companions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast-paced multiplayer party games full of chaos and strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Endless combinations of player-created characters, powers, and loadouts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A living world shaped by community creativity and co-creation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explore strange locations, bizarre events, and unpredictable gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Collect, customise, and develop your Wilds over time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Built around creativity, imagination, and expressive play</p>", "short_description": "Let your imagination run Wilds! From the BAFTA nominated team at Night Zookeeper, Wilds is an online adventure bound only by the limits of your creativity. Create characters, bring them to life, and embark on your own adventure in fast paced multiplayer action.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/607a84c2b8ce2f56afe73a6486181bf16d369a44/header.jpg?t=1783516200", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/1a729c153194fb469a1182966d1752a2573a59e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783516200", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150750/1a729c153194fb469a1182966d1752a2573a59e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783516200", "website": "https://www.wildsgame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>